+// Watch 3 Pro (jx402_08 1.0.1.77): the watch face guard (wp2-core wfguard.rs) and a "Set Light" entry in the stock
+// app list (applist.rs) that opens a stand-up set timer (setlight.rs). `wp2apps firmware --model wp3` appends this
